# Optional overrides for the model_key -> numeric model_id mapping used by the image
# routes. The gateway resolves most ids on its own:
#   1. /v1/aimoss/repair/home_v2 gives model_group_key -> model_group_id (authoritative)
#   2. /v1/account/get pairs display names with ids, matched back onto model_keys
#   3. this file, which always wins
#
# Use it when a model the gateway could not place shows up as a 404, or to pin a
# specific tier (for example a 4K variant of the same model family).
#
# format: model_key=model_id      (one per line, '#' comments allowed)

# mj2=8                  # Midjourney V7 (the account catalog id)
# nanobanana2=97         # 香蕉 Pro 2K
# gptimage2=142          # ChatGPT Image 2 (2K)
